          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Observation of the successive passage of two luminous phenomena in the sky on a straight trajectory: probable observation of the passage of Thai lanterns.",
          "translation_text_sha256": "fa1d2b38ecb31f473158f6fc7f0ece75ae46fb1aab6c44156a6f0c2d23c9d44c"
